#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:5
#: 1aa4408ab1fc4eea97724d477e172adc 78c370d893d94cb582ffe3f738393aab
#: 93479d700419428bbdbf2f4fe19e1076 c6a0b83987e8486384d25723a4b124fe
#: e306769cd7174aa0b27183761eee140e
msgid "Maxbotix Analog Sonar"
msgstr "Maxbotix 模拟声呐"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:7
#: 1341a256189a450885d0d73a4e2fb3b9 6d57833fb8af442691f3056cca1d3b20
#: 70e281a295394eb0bd54710fdcf7cbb4 7ce674a9c94644b1b1aa60519f64d68a
#: d3fa2ec61e98434a9ad3af076fed1281
msgid ""
"`XL-Maxbotix-EZ <https://www.maxbotix.com/product-category/xl-maxsonar-ez-"
"products/>`__ line of analog sonars (XL-MaxSonar-EZ0, EZ4 and EZL0) are "
"relatively inexpensive, short range (7m to 10m) range finder primarily "
"designed for indoor use but which has been successfully used outdoors on "
"Copter and Rover.  These are the predecessors to :ref:`I2C sonar <common-"
"rangefinder-maxbotixi2c>`."
msgstr ""
"`XL-Maxbotix-EZ <https://www.maxbotix.com/product-category/xl-maxsonar-ez-"
"products/>`__ 系列模拟声呐（XL-MaxSonar-EZ0、EZ4 和 EZL0）价格相对低廉，量程较短（7m 至 "
"10m），主要为室内使用设计，但也已成功用于 Copter 和 Rover 的室外环境。这些设备是 :ref:`I2C 声呐 <common-"
"rangefinder-maxbotixi2c>` 的前代产品。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:14
#: 1724b5c338aa40989ba7e132d4cbf3ce 5e9fc763451847f8a1e89ade1926b99f
#: b16d77978899412fb52642ac1524126f d559e33f66ad4e0987ebe6d6bc471d31
#: f93d94f8f4b04e82ae8d72af50c025e3
msgid ""
"The `EZ4 <https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1240.htm>`__ "
"(recommended) has the narrowest beam providing the best noise resistance "
"while the `EZ0 <https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1200.htm>`__ "
"has the widest beam and higher sensitivity.  The long range `EZL0 "
"<https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1260.htm>`__ has the same "
"sensitivity as the EZ0 but a 10m range (as opposed to 7m)."
msgstr ""
"`EZ4 <https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1240.htm>`__ "
"（推荐）波束最窄，抗干扰性最佳；`EZ0 "
"<https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1200.htm>`__ 波束最宽，灵敏度最高。远程版 "
"`EZL0 <https://www.maxbotix.com/Ultrasonic_Sensors/MB1260.htm>`__ 与 EZ0 "
"灵敏度相同，但量程为 10m（而非 7m）。"

