msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-maxbotix-analog.rst:59
#: 7751714970fe41aca1e147a090eff6af 8edd76c56dea472c86e131a6c409d62e
#: d92154ea33624f52803b4fe7b722ebf6 e4997d6cd30e4ab087f0dea7fb7542dd
#: fb9e418f56614dc9b1cdd71de198f62f
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请注意查找 「rangefinder1」。"
